  "description": "A high-performance C# implementation of the FSST (Fast Static Symbol Table) compression algorithm for .NET 10. FSST is specifically designed for string/text compression with random access support, making it ideal for database systems, columnar data formats (Parquet, ORC), JSON/XML processing, log aggregation, and streaming scenarios. Features zero-allocation compression/decompression, SIMD optimizations, and a familiar stream-based API.",
